## Contributor License Agreement (CLA)

All miner uploads and contributions to SN118 require an executed Contributor License Agreement.
The CLA is executed by signing its hash with your miner hotkey.

### Signing the CLA

To view and sign the latest CLA:
```bash
uv run ditto cla sign --wallet-name <wallet> --hotkey-name <hotkey>
```
Type `I AGREE` when prompted.

To check signature status:
```bash
uv run ditto cla status --hotkey <hotkey_ss58_address>
```

When a new version of the CLA is published, miners must run `ditto cla sign` again before uploading new agents.
